              "text": "प्रायः — prāyaḥ — \"for the most part; usually\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "उस समय युद्ध प्रायः तलवार और भाले से होते थे। us samay yuddh prāyaḥ talvār aur bhāle se hote the. In those days wars were mostly fought with swords and spears."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Formal and written; speech says अक्सर."
            }
          ]
        },
