          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "प्रायः (prāyaḥ) is Sanskrit prāyas, \"for the most part, mostly\" (Monier-Williams), and keeps the final sign ः. It belongs to writing and to formal talk."
            }
          ]
